{#
    Username - One-line user display name link

    Renders the user's name as a profile link clamped to a single line. The link is the
    clipping element and ellipsises; the wrapper stays unclipped and carries the CSS
    tooltip, which is what lets the full name expand past the tile boundary on hover.

    Used in:    templates/_components/usercard.html.twig
    Parameters:
        - link (string, required) - URL to the user's profile page
        - name (string, required) - display name shown as the link text
    Depends on: .has-tooltip and .usercard-name in assets/styles/custom.scss
#}
<span class="usercard-name has-tooltip" data-tooltip="{{ name }}">
    <a href="{{ link }}">{{ name }}</a>
</span>
